      "content_en": "I remembered that positions were closed out before the market opened in the past, so when leverage was restricted to 5x I was worried and panicking, but it held up normally until the open.\n\nThank you to the Exness staff member who helped even though it was the weekend, and to President Manbo who contacted them via LINE.",
