    "2117073365471199665": {
      "account_followers": 9649,
      "account_handle": "Princess_M555",
      "account_name": "お美沙🌷Princess-M💰爆益舎",
      "bookmarks": 9,
      "content_en": "In my overseas FX history, the one I've used most heavily is... definitely XM.\nI'm unhappy with the spreads, but above all it's easy to use. It has a wide range of instruments...\nAnd the fact that there are no problems with withdrawals is also highly rated by me personally!\n\nThe next ones I used were... exness  bigboss Titan スリトレ (Suritore) Vantage  axi   　and I also used Gem...\n\nThere are so many that I can't remember them all, but it's roughly like this☺️",
      "content_original": "私の海外FX史において、一番ヘビーに使ったのは・・\nやはりXMなんですよね。　\nスプレッドには不満があるが何といっても使いやすいよ。銘柄数が豊富だし・・\nそれと出金に問題がない点も個人的には高評価！\n\n次に使ったのが・・exness  bigboss Titan スリトレ　Vantage  axi   　あとGemも使ってたわ・・\n\n色々ありすぎて全部思い出せないけど・・・だいたいこんな感じ☺️",
